# WINDSURF.md example

Defaults for Cascade-style workflows:
- define scope before implementation;
- keep validation explicit;
- stop for risky changes, dependencies and migrations.

Before broad edits, ask the AI to produce a compact evidence map first.
Do not let it scan and rewrite the project in one step.

If the IDE supports multiple passes, prefer:
- a lighter read-only discovery pass;
- a focused implementation pass;
- an independent review pass before merge or deploy.
